### Counters Service API Tests

### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8087/health

### Create Counter
POST http://localhost:8087/api/v1/counters
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subscriber_id": 1,
  "serial_number": "ABCD-12345",
  "type": "cold",
  "installation_date": "2024-01-15",
  "initial_value": 100.0
}

### List Counters (paginated)
GET http://localhost:8087/api/v1/counters?page=1&limit=20

### List Counters with filters
GET http://localhost:8087/api/v1/counters?subscriber_id=1&type=cold

### Get Counter by ID
GET http://localhost:8087/api/v1/counters/1

### Get Counters by Subscriber
GET http://localhost:8087/api/v1/subscribers/1/counters

### Get Active Counters by Subscriber
GET http://localhost:8087/api/v1/subscribers/1/counters/active

### Get Counter Status
GET http://localhost:8087/api/v1/counters/1/status

### Get Counter Statuses by Subscriber
GET http://localhost:8087/api/v1/subscribers/1/counters/statuses

### Get Dashboard
GET http://localhost:8087/api/v1/counters/dashboard

### Update Counter
PUT http://localhost:8087/api/v1/counters/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "verification_date": "2024-06-15"
}

### Verify Counter
POST http://localhost:8087/api/v1/counters/1/verify
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "verification_date": "2024-06-15",
  "verified_value": 150.5
}

### Activate Counter
POST http://localhost:8087/api/v1/counters/1/activate

### Deactivate Counter
POST http://localhost:8087/api/v1/counters/1/deactivate

### Delete Counter
DELETE http://localhost:8087/api/v1/counters/1
